# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit honors "<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore" and it OVERRIDES the root
# .dockerignore for builds with `-f mayhem/Dockerfile`). Upstream's root .dockerignore is `*` +
# a tiny allowlist tuned for OSS-Fuzz's `docker build .`; it would strip .git, mayhem/, .github/ and
# submodules/googletest from OUR context. We cannot edit that tracked file additively, so this
# additive sibling file restores the full dev-image context the spec requires (full source + .git +
# all submodules), dropping only local build artifacts and editor/OS cruft.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft (produced inside the image by mayhem/build.sh; absent from a clean
#    checkout — listed only so a pre-existing local build doesn't bloat the context) ──────────────
build/
_out/
artifacts/
mayhem/_out/
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
